    "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>This dataset was collected by Robert R. Rozeske and Leonie Runtz in the laboratory of Mark P. Brandon. All methods and details are described in the research publication where these data were originally published: Rozeske, Runtz, Lee, Keinath, Sossin, and Brandon (2026) <em>Nature Neuroscience.</em> Overlapping representations in the ventral hippocampus support rapid fear memory retrieval. The dataset (MATLAB .mat files in the zipped \"data\" folder) is organized by experimental group.</span></p>",
